   "ply": 10,
   "t": 89.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/2n2n2/8/1b1NP3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 1 6",
   "line": [
    "Bb4"
   ],
   "spoken": "He threatens the knight to e4, pinning ours — and we can't answer with Bd2, that drops the knight; the centre is under real pressure, so play accurately."
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 109,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/2N2n2/8/1b2P3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "Nxc6"
   ],
   "spoken": "First, relieve the pressure — trade the knight, which then lets us reinforce the e4 pawn."
  },
  {
   "ply": 12,
   "t": 123,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/2N2n2/8/4P3/2b5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 7",
